	quest.2B2DA9C17AD1456B.quest_desc: [
		"Thermodynamic Conductor is the heat pipe for Mekanism logistics."
		""
		"[ \"The behavior of each of the pipe's connection can be changed by Shift + right-clicking the end of a pipe with a \", { \"text\": \"Configurator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2E5025697AF514D2\" } }, \":\" ]"
		"&6Normal&r — passive"
		"&aPush&r — actively inserts items"
		"&ePull&r — actively extracts items"
		"None — disables connection"
		""
		"[ \"Can be colored to avoid confusion and stop different pipes from conecting to eachother, to do this Shift + Right-click base of the pipe with a \", { \"text\": \"Configurator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2E5025697AF514D2\" } } ]"
		""
		"&8Can be upgraded with Alloys by either combining 8 pipes and 1 alloy, or by right-clicking the pipe while Alloy is in hand.&r"
	]
