	quest.35BACE818EA06318.quest_desc: [
		"Fluid Pipes are blocks used to transport and deal with fluids. "
		""
		"Normal pipes laid parallel to each other will automatically connect. Fluid Pipes can be adjacent without connecting if they have been made transparent with a Wrench."
		""
		"Fluid Pipes can only move one liquid at a time; if different liquids intersect, the pipe will clog."
		""
		"When outputting a fluid into air, the pipe will leak, spraying the fluid out in front of it. If possible, a fluid source block will be placed in the world after the pipe outputs 1000mB of fluid."
	]
	quest.35BF1D9F8D139459.quest_desc: ["The Rotational Complex is a block used in the Industrial Turbine. It does nothing except as an element to assemble the Industrial Turbine. It should be placed horizontally centered in the structure, above the rotor with blades."]
	quest.35BF1D9F8D139459.quest_subtitle: "Rotational Complex? I find it quite simple actually."
