	quest.3CED874E55E5D1E3.quest_desc: [
		"Table Cloths can be used as decoration or to sell items to other players."
		""
		"Right-click a Stock Keeper with the Table Cloth to open the UI. From the interface, add items to be sold on the Table Cloth, then click “Configure” to confirm. One Table Cloth can sell up to 9 different types of items at once."
	]
	quest.3CED874E55E5D1E3.title: "Table Cloth"
	quest.3DD064405C55BF12.quest_desc: [
		"Vault block has a storage space of 20 stacks. Items cannot be added or removed by the player, but by automation (pipes, funnels, etc)."
		""
		"Item Vaults will connect with other Item Vaults. 1x1 vaults can be up to 3 blocks long, 2x2 vaults can be 6 blocks long, and 3x3 vaults can be 9 blocks long, resulting in a maximum storage space of 1620 stacks in one Item Vault multiblock."
	]
