	quest.3F39DF7EED3DBAED.quest_subtitle: "Godlike Transfer Rates"
	quest.3FB70B2734FF2281.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Mixer is a mechanical component that applies Mixing recipes and shapeless Crafting recipes to items in Basins."
		""
		"The Mechanical Mixer is powered by an internal cogwheel, and will behave as one to any adjacent components, relaying and reversing rotation sideways."
		""
		"The Mixer requires a minimum rotational speed of 30 RPM from its power source to work. Mixers will process ingredients faster the more speed it is given."
		""
		"To work, a Mixer must be placed directly above a Basin, with a 1 block gap. When a valid recipe is inserted by throwing the ingredients in the Mixer, the Mixer will automatically combine the ingredients."
	]
	quest.4004129749B191AF.quest_desc: ["The Essence Extractor is used for taking essence from mobs, animals, and players. With some enchantments, you can get higher tiers of essence. Tier 3 player essence is useful for giving specific players access to things like fleshkin chests."]
	quest.4004129749B191AF.title: "Steal your friends DNA!"
	quest.407A917EF08B601F.quest_desc: [
		"Placing a Belt requires at least two Shafts. Place the Belt by right-clicking on the first shaft and then right clicking the second. Regardless of the length, this only consumes one mechanical belt. Both shafts must face the same direction."
		""
		"A Mechanical Belt can be placed over any number of Shafts arranged horizontally, vertically, or diagonally (45° towards the y axis) in a single line."
		""
		"The Mechanical Belt can transport items from one location to another. Items can either be thrown onto the belt, and machines such as Funnels, Chutes or Mechanical Arms can place items onto the belt or remove items from the belt. A belt can also transport entities and the player."
		""
		"When rotational force is connected to any shaft of a belt, the belt conveys identical force to every other shaft it is connected to. As such, if two shafts are connected to external sources of rotational force, a belt cannot be placed connecting them unless the force is in the same direction and at the same speed."
	]
	quest.414874164A8292BE.quest_desc: [
		"[ \"The Chemical Washer turns \", { \"text\": \"Dirty Slurry\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1320FCEE195D9D91\" } }, \" into \", { \"text\": \"Clean Slurry\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4A6AF19B37DBD45C\" } }, \" using Water. \" ]"
		""
		"The clean slurry then needs to be further refined by pumping it into a Chemical Crystallizer."
	]
	quest.417DA7A05E8691B2.title: "Deuterium"
	quest.41C9560241679D59.quest_desc: ["Will extinguish flames on the wearers body, however only if they arent standing in something thats making them be on fire"]
