	quest.4626651C4914FE3E.quest_desc: [
		"The Weighted Ejector flings items and entities to a targeted block up to 32 blocks away."
		""
		"To select a target, sneak+use the ejector on the desired target block, then place the ejector some distance away. The target must be in a straight line from where the Ejector is placed. The maximum range of the selection target is 32 blocks horizontally, and infinite blocks vertically."
		""
		"The ejector can be recharged by connecting rotational power to its input. Recharge time increases with distance, but can be sped up by increasing the input's RPM."
	]
