	quest.4F38DA1E7F090A2D.quest_desc: ["Highlights mobs around you, even through walls, at the cost of mana!"]
	quest.4F38DA1E7F090A2D.quest_subtitle: "Open your inner eye"
	quest.4F430B8696F246F5.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical Saws are powered through rotational force, and when placed down facing to the side they will automatically chop down wood blocks in front of them. When chopping down a tree or giant mushroom, it will automatically destroy the entire tree by only destroying the bottom-most block."
		""
		"Mechanical saws can mine any structure of logs that doesn't have a vertical 2x2 square with the block being destroyed as one of the bottom blocks"
		""
		"Mechanical saws are automatically powered when on a create Contraption."
		""
		"When placed facing upward, the Saw applies sawing or stonecutting recipes. When a recipe has multiple outputs, an output will be randomly selected unless a filter is applied to the Filter slot located next to the saw blade"
	]
	quest.4F8BC723069B57B1.quest_desc: [
		"Can be used to store fluids. Single Fluid Tank holds up to 8 buckets of fluid"
		""
		"Can be joined in 2x2 or 3x3 groups, can also be stacked vertically allowing to store 2160 Buckets of fluid."
		""
		"Fluid Vessel is same as Fluid Tank but expands horizontally."
	]
	quest.4F8BC723069B57B1.title: "Fluid Tank"
	quest.5099494C667223FB.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.5099494C667223FB.title: "Thorium"
	quest.50D71D45609DA8CF.quest_desc: [
		"The Redstone Link is used to send and receive redstone signals to other links."
		""
		"To toggle the redstone link between sending and receiving a signal, sneak and right click it or right click with a Wrench. A receiving redstone link has a signal dish on the antenna."
		""
		"The frequency can be changed by right clicking the link's slots with an item or block. Assign an item or block to at least one of the two frequency slots, and the redstone link will only send or receive signals to or from links with matching frequency slots."
		""
		"The link's frequency can also be copied and pasted by right-clicking with a Clipboard."
		""
		"Redstone links transfer redstone signals across long distances, keeping their redstone signal strength. When powered, a sending link causes receiving Redstone Links with matching frequency to emit redstone. The signal strength is kept. Receivers will output the strongest redstone strength received from sending links."
	]
	quest.50FCED613F26E315.quest_subtitle: "Dear god!"
	quest.511AEB6922CD83BA.quest_desc: ["Now that that's over... we can move on to the next step. You'll need a List Filter for this one, and some water."]
	quest.511AEB6922CD83BA.title: "Filtering"
	quest.51B69CE0DACBFCAE.quest_desc: [
		"Electrical Motors generate rotation from FE, input FE from any side, and output rotation from front. You can change RPM by holding wrench, right-clicking and draging RPM slider on the side of the motor. "
		""
		"Reinforced Motor can generate up to 8192 SU on its own."
		""
		"&8Ponder is available for this block&r"
	]
	quest.51C57A02C2F76A57.title: "Chlorine"
	quest.52080EC8F3699E91.quest_desc: [
		"To build New Age Nuclear Reactor:"
		""
		"[ \"Make some sort of base out of \", { \"text\": \"radiation resistant blocks\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"152341867F6CA47C\" } }, \", place Reactor Rods, connect Reactor Heat Vent and Reactor Fuel Inserter, encase rods in  radiation resistant blocks.\" ]"
	]
	quest.52080EC8F3699E91.title: "How to: Basic Reactor"
	quest.5210BFF097EA8975.quest_desc: [
		"The Chain Conveyor is used to transport Cardboard Packages. It has a secondary use of transferring rotational force across open spaces."
		""
		"After placing a Chain Conveyor, they can be connected to other Chain Conveyors by right-clicking them with a Chain. The selection can be cleared by right-clicking the Chain Conveyor again. The maximum distance at which chain conveyors can be connected is 32 blocks."
		""
		"Right-click a Chain Conveyor with a Wrench to take a ride. Sneak to dismount. When approaching an intersection, the player will be sent in the direction they’re looking towards"
		""
		"Cardboard Packages can be placed on Chain Conveyors via right-click. Package Frogports are used to automatically move Cardboard Packages from and to the Chain Conveyors. Chain Conveyors will automatically sort packages by their Address to send them to Frogports with a matching Address."
	]
	quest.526A77EEB8CB20F6.title: "find it somewhere"
	quest.526DAD5166DA270D.quest_desc: ["Fluid valves can be used to close or open the flow in a pipe. Fluid Valves can be switched between open and closed by providing Rotational Force to the side. This is often done with a Valve Handle or Gearshift."]
