	quest.59EA4D9F875D7D03.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Infuser combines two gases to create another gas. "
		""
		"The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which outputs through the front of the machine. The input and output sides can be changed in the UI of the machine."
	]
